SUMMARY:RENT: In Concert
DESCRIPTION:Run Time: 2 hours and 10 minutes\, including one 20-minute intermission \n\n\nExperience the iconic music of RENT like never before. In this sweeping symphonic concert produced by AMP Worldwide\, a powerhouse ensemble of vocalists and instrumentalists brings Jonathan Larson’s groundbreaking rock musical to life in a sweeping symphonic concert. Featuring the full score — including Seasons of Love\, La Vie Bohème\, Take Me or Leave Me\, and more — this electrifying performance celebrates the enduring spirit of love\, loss\, and chosen family. \n\n\nSet in New York City’s East Village at the height of the HIV/AIDS crisis\, RENT follows a group of young artists as they chase their dreams\, navigate heartbreak\, and fight to live—and love—fully in the moment. Winner of the Tony Award for Best Musical and the Pulitzer Prize for Drama\, RENT remains a cultural touchstone with music that resonates across generations. \n\n\nRecommended for ages 13 and up.
URL:https://www.peakperfs.org/event/rent/
CATEGORIES:2026 - 2027
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.peakperfs.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/RENT.jpg
END:VEVENT
